    <section style="margin-top:1.2rem" class="card reveal" data-reveal>
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Myths versus practical truth</h3>
      <ul class="muted small">
        <li><strong>Myth:</strong> Integrative means unscientific. <strong>Truth:</strong> We knit lifestyle, evidence-informed techniques, and collaboration with clinicians when needed.</li>
        <li><strong>Myth:</strong> Change requires big overhaul. <strong>Truth:</strong> Tiny, repeated experiments compound into reliable shifts over time.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:1rem" class="reveal" data-reveal>
      <h3>Who we work with</h3>
      <p class="muted">People navigating chronic stress, intermittent symptoms, or those seeking a clearer routine around sleep, digestion, mood, and daily energy. We do not offer emergency care or guarantee cures — our role is educational and supportive.</p>
